# Distribution for CommonsBase_Dk (Linux x86_64)

Ships the `dk0` and `dk1` executables, each built from source as a
per-package opam closure (CommonsBase_Dk.Dk0.Closure / Dk1.Closure) and
republished as a single native executable.

## Dk0 executable

  $ get-object CommonsBase_Dk.Dk0@2.4.2 -s Release.Linux_x86_64 -m ./bin/dk0.exe -f ${RUNTIME}/Linux_x86_64-dk0.exe
  \test(pass)
  \dk.object(abi: "Release.Linux_x86_64", value-id: "ojnw46bilxdfbbay4x4f6wbe4md55sfj5vrg7ssk25y722n7tjapq")\;

## Dk1 executable

  $ get-object CommonsBase_Dk.Dk1@2.4.2 -s Release.Linux_x86_64 -m ./bin/dk1.exe -f ${RUNTIME}/Linux_x86_64-dk1.exe
  \test(pass)
  \dk.object(abi: "Release.Linux_x86_64", value-id: "ocugsqb254bl2dshjuw4wikomf2lypacjjyv4luqtjscpoyxrhm4a")\;

## TestPkg (with-test external closure, imported by the MlFront test gate)

  $ get-object CommonsBase_Dk.TestPkg@2.4.2 -s Release.Linux_x86_64 -m ./prefix.zip -d ./testpkg
  \test(pass)
  \dk.object(abi: "Release.Linux_x86_64", value-id: "ovkwj67odprf3yfjc4ap4pqr4vls3li6pv3w5gl5onjowuqbdl3yq")\;
